# ==============================================================================
# PART 2: SUMMARY OF CHANGES PRE-MST (TILL SEPTEMBER 8, 2026)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. CORE ARCHITECTURE & SYSTEM FOUNDATION
#    - Initialized frontend with Vite, React 19, and Tailwind/CSS custom properties.
#    - Integrated Supabase PostgreSQL database with Row-Level Security (RLS) policies.
#    - Built Express.js backend server (server/index.js) running on port 5000 with
#      REST endpoints for health checks, listings, conversations, and student profiles.
#    - Enforced institutional boundary: verified Google OAuth restricted strictly
#      to @thapar.edu hosted domain (hd: thapar.edu).
#
# 2. MARKETPLACE SUPPLY ENGINE (Listings & Sellers)
#    - Created listing ingestion pipeline: title, category, price in INR (Rs),
#      item condition (New, Like New, Good, Fair), and campus pickup locations.
#    - Implemented device image upload replacing external image URL inputs.
#    - Built dedicated 'My Selling Space' modal (MySellingItemsModal.jsx) allowing
#      students to view, manage, edit, mark as sold, mark as reserved, or delete listings.
#    - Multi-criteria filter bar: categories, price range sliders, and condition tags.
#
# 3. REAL-TIME BUYER-SELLER MESSAGING & CHAT SYSTEM
#    - Built conversational interface (ChatModal.jsx) with message deduplication,
#      status tracking (sending, sent, delivered), and optimistic UI updates.
#    - Implemented interactive Messages dropdown in the top navbar.
#    - Added live polling engine (3-second interval) as a robust fallback for
#      cross-device sync across different hostel Wi-Fi networks.
#
# 4. DISCOVERY & PEER REPUTATION SYSTEM
#    - Smart Search Bar (smartSearch.js): fuzzy token matching, relevance ranking,
#      and campus synonym resolution (e.g., 'Casio', 'Dorm Fridge', 'Cycles', 'DSA books').
#    - Mutual Trade Reviews & Ratings (ReviewModal.jsx): 5-star ratings, trade tags,
#      and textual feedback synchronized with Supabase student profile summaries.

