# PART 3: SUMMARY OF CHANGES POST-MST (AFTER SEPTEMBER 8, 2026)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. CAMPUS ITEM REQUESTS & WANTED BOARD (Demand-Side Inverted Marketplace)
#    - Addressed supply-only limitation: allowed students to post 'Wanted' requests
#      for items not currently available on the campus market.
#    - Developed CampusRequestsModal.jsx and CreateItemRequestModal.jsx.
#    - Created REST endpoints (/api/item-requests) and Supabase table schema
#      (item_requests) with full RLS permissions for student requesters.
#    - Captures requested item name, category, maximum budget, and preferred pickup spot.
#
# 2. AUTOMATED HEURISTIC MATCH DETECTION ENGINE
#    - Implemented multi-criteria matching algorithm (AppContext.jsx & smartSearch.js).
#    - Scans listings against active requests using:
#        a) Bidirectional substring inclusion across title and description.
#        b) Tokenized relevance scoring (calculateListingRelevanceScore >= 20).
#        c) Significant keyword set intersection (>= 3 chars, filtering stop words).
#        d) Domain category matching.
#    - Two-way instant scanning: scans existing listings upon request creation,
#      and scans active requests upon new listing creation.
#
# 3. PRODUCTION GMAIL SMTP REAL INBOX DELIVERY PIPELINE
#    - Integrated Nodemailer service in server/emailService.js.
#    - Connected live SMTP over port 465 SSL/TLS using authenticated Gmail service
#      account (noreply.notolx@gmail.com) and 16-character Google App Passwords.
#    - Implemented automatic space-stripping sanitization and disk .env discovery.
#    - Designed RFC 2822-compliant responsive HTML email templates with Thapar Maroon
#      institutional branding (#5E2424) for high inbox deliverability (SPF/DKIM).
#    - Instant Request Confirmation: sends immediate confirmation email when a student
#      posts a wanted request on the campus board.
#    - Instant Match Alerts: emails the requester with listing title, price, condition,
#      campus pickup location, and deep link to start a chat with the seller.
#    - Unified backend routing across Vite Dev Connect Middleware, Express, and Vercel.
#
# 4. BESPOKE VINTAGE EDITORIAL PRINT REDESIGN
#    - Replaced generic flat/dark modes with a unified Vintage Parchment & Maroon theme.
#    - Generated custom high-res handmade cotton rag paper background with realistic
#      torn deckle edges (public/marketplace-bg.jpg) on warm ivory base (#F2E8DC).
#    - Created distressed dry-brush maroon logo typography (notolx-distressed-logo.png).
#    - Harmonized palette: --bg-app (#F3E6DD), --bg-card (#E8DCCF),
#      --primary (#5E2424 Thapar Maroon), --text-main (#221616).
#    - Added frosted semi-transparent sticky navbar with backdrop-filter blur.
#
# 5. ENGINEERING GOVERNANCE & AGENT RULES
